% Scenario: a link with a URI action, a visible border, and a colour.
% The annotation carries the action dictionary, the border the mark
% gave, and the colour; the page paints the underline the link sits on.
[ /Rect [72 700 300 720] /Border [0 0 1] /Color [0 0 1]
  /Action << /Subtype /URI /URI (https://example.org/) >>
  /Subtype /Link /ANN pdfmark
72 700 moveto 300 700 lineto stroke
showpage
